=== Castiel ===
Ariel is the oldest sister of the [[seraphim]] [[Castiel]]. Like Lucifer, Ariel does know of Castiel and she sees him as a brother and she also loves him very much as well. During Castiel's younger years as a angel, he would respect his eldest sister Ariel very much. Ariel loves to spend time with her younger brother very much. Ariel is very protective of Castiel and she was very happy to see her younger brother again after many years. Like Gabriel, Ariel have never try to hurt or kill Castiel, because Ariel said to Dean and Sam that she loves Castiel very much and she sees him as her brother.

*Ariel is Amara's eldest niece as well.
*Ariel loves her younger brother Castiel very much.
*Ariel likes to eat sweets. Her favorite sweets are chocolate.
*Ariel is Heterosexual. Ariel has dated and slept with a couple of boys.
*Ariel is very loyal to her brothers and father.

